    <td style="width: 0.25in; padding-right: 0.8pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(4)</span></td>
    <td style="padding-right: 0.8pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Approved an additional 2,900,000 shares of common stock for issuance under the 2021 Equity Incentive Plan.</span></td></tr>
  </table>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 29.05pt">&#160;</p>

